  "body_text": "本期订阅豆如下：\nPanama Berlina Gesha Natural 巴拿马 柏林娜庄园 瑰夏 日晒\nPanama Berlina Gesha Washed\n巴\n拿马 柏林娜\n庄园\n瑰夏 水洗\n挂耳包的订阅套餐中也会有这两只豆子\n关于订阅补充说明：\n本期将于10.25号陆续发出\n，\n如果需要暂停订阅或者地址有变化，请及时与客服联系暂停或更改；\n更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺～\n公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          本期订阅豆如下：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n            Panama Berlina Gesha Natural 巴拿马 柏林娜庄园 瑰夏 日晒\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n            Panama Berlina Gesha Washed\n            <span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n             巴\n            </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n             拿马 柏林娜\n            </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-